= Instructions

Place #Martini or coupe glasses{2} in the refrigerator or freezer for at least ~{5 minutes} to chill.

Place @Ice{1 cup} cubes, room temperature brewed @Espresso{2 oz}, @Vodka{1 oz}, @Coffee liqueur{1/2 oz}, 
@Simple syrup{1/2 oz}, and @Half-and-half, optional{1/2 oz} in a blender, preferably high-speed. 
Using the tamper if needed, blend until smooth, about ~{1 minute}.

Divide between the chilled glasses and garnish with @Coffee beans{} if desired.